---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---
<AppLayout title="Privacy Policy – NearSpot">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: June 2025</p>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">We collect information you provide directly, including:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-600 space-y-1">
        <li>Phone number and profile details during registration</li>
        <li>Location data to show nearby stores and services</li>
        <li>Transaction and reservation history</li>
        <li>Messages exchanged with vendors through the platform</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-600 space-y-1">
        <li>To provide and personalise the NearSpot experience</li>
        <li>To process reservations and payments</li>
        <li>To send notifications about orders, offers, and platform updates</li>
        <li>To improve our services through aggregated analytics</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">3. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        We do not sell your personal data. We share limited information with vendors only as
        necessary to fulfil a reservation (e.g. your name and contact for an accepted booking).
        Payment data is handled by our payment processor and is never stored on our servers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">4. Data Retention</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        We retain your data for as long as your account is active. You may request deletion
        of your account and associated data by contacting us at
        <a href="mailto:support@nearspot.in" class="text-navy underline">support@nearspot.in</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">5. Security</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        We use industry-standard encryption (HTTPS/TLS) for all data in transit. Passwords
        are hashed and never stored in plaintext. Access to production systems is restricted
        to authorised personnel only.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-3">6. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        For privacy-related enquiries, email
        <a href="mailto:privacy@nearspot.in" class="text-navy underline">privacy@nearspot.in</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</AppLayout>
